{"availability":"available","full":"dev-kevzeb/olimpia","name":"olimpia","description":"Registration platform for academic olympiads: calls, student registration (form or Excel), payment slips and automatic PDF receipt verification. Laravel 8 + React/TypeScript. Includes a frontend-only demo with MSW.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-26T16:57:12Z","updated":"2026-09-30T22:10:02Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://olimpia-wkz.vercel.app","topics":["education","full-stack","laravel","management-system","material-ui","msw","php","react","sanctum","tailwindcss","typescript","vite"],"demo":"https://olimpia-wkz.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.399Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.399Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.399Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.399Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Registration platform for academic olympiads — calls for participation, student registration (form or Excel), payment slips, automatic payment-receipt verification from PDF, and reports.","Demo: runs entirely in the browser with fictitious data; use “Entrar como administrador (demo)” on the login page to open the admin panel.","🇪🇸 Resumen: Olimpia es un sistema de inscripción a olimpiadas académicas. El administrador crea convocatorias con áreas, niveles y costos; los tutores inscriben estudiantes (uno a uno o por Excel), descargan la boleta de pago y suben el recibo en PDF, que el sistema lee y valida automáticamente para confirmar el pago. Incluye panel de administración y reportes por área, nivel, colegio, departamento, provincia y género."],"features":["Public (tutors and students)","Registration of one or several students per payment order, with the areas and levels allowed for each student's grade.","Bulk registration from an Excel template generated for the open call.","Payment slip (PDF) with a unique code (OLP-YYYY-NNNNN) and registration status lookup by ID number.","Payment receipt upload: the PDF is parsed and checked against the order (code, amount and payer). If it matches, the order is marked as paid."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dev-kevzeb/olimpia/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0b9367938e093c453fbb48edc015ea5fa418de5dc305c20937da4e49d34897b0","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.562Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.562Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Registration platform for academic olympiads — calls for participation, student registration (form or Excel), payment slips, automatic payment-receipt verification from PDF, and reports.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dev-kevzeb/olimpia/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Demo: runs entirely in the browser with fictitious data; use “Entrar como administrador (demo)” on the login page to open the admin panel.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dev-kevzeb/olimpia/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Login attempt tracking and security panel.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dev-kevzeb/olimpia/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"0b9367938e093c453fbb48edc015ea5fa418de5dc305c20937da4e49d34897b0","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dev-kevzeb/olimpia/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.563Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-30T22:10:02Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dev-kevzeb/olimpia/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.563Z","hash":"0b9367938e093c453fbb48edc015ea5fa418de5dc305c20937da4e49d34897b0","originalBytes":5440,"storedBytes":5440,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["demo","backend","api","frontend","registration","admin","npm","pdf","php","screenshots","calls","data","docs","form","mode","run","sqlite","tests","app","artisan","bash","build","controllers","database",